OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 14 JUN
OL,4,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,5,     GJoin Sarah Walker for a colourful
OL,6,     GSunday mix, from pastoral
OL,7,     Glandscapes and Renaissance choral
OL,8,     Gmusic to Russian orchestral drama
OL,9,     Gand moments of reflection.
OL,10,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,11,     GMichael Berkeley's guest in the
OL,12,     Gbroadcaster Jeremy Vine.
OL,13,G1330FMusic Map
OL,14,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch explores the
OL,15,     Gpathways to one of football
OL,16,     Gfanatic Shostakovich's most
OL,17,     Gcelebrated works, with Handel's
OL,18,     GUEFA anthem and balalaikas from
OL,19,     GJoe Hisaishi along the way.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
