OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 14 JUN
OL,4,G1500FMark Radcliffe's Nature Ramblings
OL,5,     GIn the final part of Mark
OL,6,     GRadcliffe's Nature Ramblings, he
OL,7,     Gfeatures music inspired by
OL,8,     Grivers, including Wagner, Delius,
OL,9,     GSmetana and Joni Mitchell.
OL,10,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,11,     GAlyn Shipton looks at the music
OL,12,     Gthat marks life's milestones with
OL,13,     Gyour personal dedications and
OL,14,     Gjazz memories.
OL,15,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,16,     GErik Bosgraaf directs the Wroclaw
OL,17,     GBaroque Orchestra at last year's
OL,18,     GLondon International Festival of
OL,19,     GEarly Music, in music by Vivaldi
OL,20,     Gand a precociously young Mozart.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
