OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 14 JUN
OL,4,G1800FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GFrom the Chapel of Keble College,
OL,6,     GOxford, with music by Wood,
OL,7,     GWesley, Stainer and Parry.
OL,8,G1900FSunday Feature: The Mysteries of
OL,9,     FGwen John
OL,10,     GGwyneth Lewis explores the
OL,11,     Gmysteries surrounding the Welsh
OL,12,     Gpainter Gwen John - an
OL,13,     Guncompromising artist who
OL,14,     Gchallenged convention and led a
OL,15,     Gstrange and fascinating life.
OL,16,G1945FWords and Music
OL,17,     GFrom the diaries of Pepys and
OL,18,     GJohn Evelyn and the music of
OL,19,     GPurcell and Blow, and films such
OL,20,     Gas The Libertine.
